    "ja": ""
  },
  "impact": {
    "en": "Witten's work has profoundly influenced both theoretical physics and mathematics. He is the only physicist to have won the Fields Medal, awarded in 1990 for his mathematical contributions, and his M-theory conjecture unified the landscape of string theories.",
